  "slug": "yellowed-light-italian-bread-toast",
  "title": "Italian Bruschetta",
  "description": "A simple yet flavorful appetizer or snack made by topping toasted Italian bread with fresh tomatoes and basil.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
